  "description": "Bring back the classics with the 20\" Kent Springer! Designed for kids and teens ages 8+, this retro-inspired cruiser combines vintage style with everyday riding fun. Featuring a durable steel frame, retro springer fork, angle adjustable high rise handlebar, and a classic banana saddle, the Springer delivers a throwback look that's sure to turn heads. The single speed drivetrain and easy to use coaster brakes keep riding simple, while the lightweight alloy wheels and 20\" smooth multi-use tires provide a comfortable ride. Complete with front and rear fenders, alloy pedals, and an adjustable seat post with quick release, the Kent Springer is ready to bring a little old-school cool to every adventure!\n\nYou can find this bike exclusively at Walmart!",
